OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fdeveloping this evening will bring a
OL,7,Fcold night with isolated frost patches
OL,8,Fin prone rural spots. Cloud returns
OL,9,Ffrom the east later, perhaps bringing
OL,10,Fpatchy rain by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,13,Fcloud thick enough to produce some
OL,14,Flight spots of rain. Best of any
OL,15,Fbrightness to the west of high ground.
OL,16,FTemperatures remaining around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
