OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,6,Fcloudy Friday and over the weekend. A
OL,7,Fsmall chance of rain at times, before
OL,8,Fbrighter spells form Sunday.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average, with
OL,10,Fovernight frost possible under any
OL,11,Fclearer skies.
